THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENSE

This pack is derived from measurements of DJI's official D-Log2 to Rec.709 conversion
LUT. The derived transforms in `luts/` are original work generated from a fitted model
and are covered by this license.

DJI's own LUT files are NOT covered by this license and are not redistributed in this
repository. To rebuild the pack from source you must obtain them yourself from DJI's
support site. See README.
